      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "答：也不全是。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Answer: not entirely.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01058",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "为自杀作辩护的蒙坦也是我的尊敬的朋友之一。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Montaigne, who defended suicide, is also one of the friends I respect.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01058",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "可是我不和不敢自杀的厌世主义者来往，诸如叔本华之流的人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But I do not associate with pessimists who lack the courage to kill themselves, people like Schopenhauer and his kind.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
